%% FIG-104 — Task execution across services (architecture F-06), v0.2
sequenceDiagram
  participant R as Researcher (qua gateway)
  participant P as planning
  participant O as orchestration
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant AC as agent-core
  participant X as service sở hữu đầu ra
  R->>P: activate Task (APR-02)
  P->>P: readiness RC-01–RC-09 (REST identity, library, research)
  P->>Q: TX: Task Queued + evt task.activated
  Q-->>O: task.activated
  O->>O: TX: Workflow task_execution, AgentRun plan_next, outbox agent.run
  O->>Q: cmd agent.run
  Q-->>AC: agent.run
  AC->>O: start (409 nếu lỗi thời) → evt workflow.started → planning: In Progress
  loop đến khi đủ đầu ra
    AC->>AC: lắp ráp context (REST các service), gọi model, kiểm tra tất định
    AC->>O: result (manifest, structured output, usage)
    O->>X: ghi đầu ra Draft (idempotency = agentRunId)
    O->>O: TX: Step Succeeded, Checkpoint, cmd agent.run bước kế
  end
  O->>Q: evt workflow.succeeded
  Q-->>P: Task In Review → Pending Action nghiệm thu (APR-03)
